// Q20 trendline buy-limit EA, strategy tester only.
// Generated by python/build_trendline_limit_ea.py.
// Defaults = saved primary run. RiskReward sets the bar-close target.
// MNQcontDTBNT20102026_2, M30; frozen contract/early-close calendars.
// Other RiskReward values are unstudied; completed results remain at 1R.
// Original source SHA256: d7a6bd0e97b3bfc119cbf90859bf6b71b7e81d69a79266ab7a8744928b3afaab
//+------------------------------------------------------------------+
//| Red-Green Breakout EA: dynamic exit + time window + candle range filters |
//| RUNBAND variant of RR_r_MFE_buy-stop-entry: same buy-stop entry, plus |
//|  + consecutive red-run BAND filter (MinRedRun / MaxRedRun)            |
//|  + LOCATION filter (skip signals closing near the range low)          |
//| With all filters off it trades exactly like the base EA.              |
//| Logs red_run and location per trade for analysis.                     |
//+------------------------------------------------------------------+
#property strict

